  "input": "Hi there,\n\nI’m reaching out because I’ve been absolutely lovely my Eufy pumps but there have been a couple issues with them. The case that they came with one of the pins is jammed in or broken so the pump will no longer charge on one side. Which is very annoying. I’ve kept it dry and clean, and have trouble shorted to no avail. I’d love to talk about options for replacing these items, hoping they are still under warranty.\n\n\nThank you so much.",
